1
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:41,640
Xiaoning.

2
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:43,560
You scared me.

3
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:45,280
Xiaoning.

4
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:46,960
Why are you here?

5
00:01:47,240 --> 00:01:48,100
Where is Shiya?

6
00:01:49,440 --> 00:01:50,479
Shiya is a bit cold.

7
00:01:50,479 --> 00:01:52,200
She asked me to chop some firewood

8
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:52,880
to warm up.

9
00:01:54,240 --> 00:01:54,840
Let me do it.

10
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:55,640
No thanks.

11
00:01:55,720 --> 00:01:56,600
I got this.

12
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:05,120
Xiaoning,

13
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:07,810
I happen to have a question for you too.

14
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:10,560
When did you...

15
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:13,200
When did you meet Shiya?

16
00:02:16,880 --> 00:02:18,040
At our wedding?

17
00:02:19,079 --> 00:02:19,880
Earlier.

18
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:21,480
Earlier?

19
00:02:23,320 --> 00:02:24,160
In college.

20
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:26,160
College?

21
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:30,040
We were in the same grade.

22
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:34,820
Why don't I remember that?

23
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:36,640
Not long after school started,

24
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:37,600
I heard

25
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:39,200
she dropped out

26
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:41,200
because her family was in debt.

27
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:42,260
The next time we met

28
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:44,079
was at your wedding.

29
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:48,440
Then,

30
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:50,680
does Shiya know you like her?

31
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:57,480
Bro.

32
00:02:58,040 --> 00:02:59,300
Don't misunderstand.

33
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:01,800
For the three years you were with her,

34
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:02,520
Shiya and I

35
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,560
did nothing to betray you.

36
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:08,240
Xiaoning,

37
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,160
what I'm about to say,

38
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:11,460
you might not believe.

39
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:14,080
But if you marry Shiya,

40
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:15,090
she will die.

41
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:16,880
She will die at your wedding.

42
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:28,920
This joke

43
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:30,440
is going a bit too far.

44
00:03:33,160 --> 00:03:33,800
Xiaoning.

45
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,000
Xiaoning.

46
00:03:35,600 --> 00:03:36,730
I am not lying to you.

47
00:03:37,040 --> 00:03:38,079
I really witnessed

48
00:03:38,079 --> 00:03:40,400
Shiya die at your wedding.

49
00:03:43,880 --> 00:03:45,079
Don't you believe me?

50
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:47,780
Do you think I would lie to you?

51
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:58,600
Brother,

52
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:00,920
of course I want to believe you.

53
00:04:00,920 --> 00:04:01,160
Then,

54
00:04:01,160 --> 00:04:01,890
but brother,

55
00:04:03,600 --> 00:04:05,130
you should also believe me.

56
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:07,500
I will protect Shiya well.

57
00:04:10,760 --> 00:04:11,480
Xiaoning.

58
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:15,040
Xiaoning.

59
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:28,730
Brother, you're awake.

60
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:31,120
You're going rock climbing?

61
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:32,440
Yeah.

62
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:34,300
Doesn't Shiya like it?

63
00:04:35,159 --> 00:04:36,290
By the way, brother.

64
00:04:36,440 --> 00:04:38,480
I remember you used to climb when you were free.

65
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:39,740
Why don't you teach me?

66
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:40,720
That way,

67
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:42,159
I can go with Shiya.

68
00:04:44,520 --> 00:04:45,040
Okay.

69
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:46,640
I'll go get my gear from the car.

70
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:47,320
No need.

71
00:04:47,320 --> 00:04:47,760
Look.

72
00:04:48,520 --> 00:04:49,850
I have everything here.

73
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:53,100
You're still missing a chalk bag.

74
00:04:59,240 --> 00:04:59,840
Xiaoning.

75
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:03,080
Come with me to the car to get a case of water.

76
00:05:05,880 --> 00:05:06,480
Okay.

77
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:59,650
Safety first in rock climbing.

78
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:00,760
I'll go first.

79
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:02,020
Watch my route.

80
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:02,760
Okay.

81
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:05,240
Where did you go this time?

82
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,840
Just went to grab something.

83
00:06:08,080 --> 00:06:09,340
Where's the rope here?

84
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:17,120
Shiya took it.

85
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:19,320
She said she went rock climbing.

86
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:20,180
Rock climbing?

87
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,730
Where did she go rock climbing?

88
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:26,540
I think it's the mountain to the east.

89
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:38,480
Shiya.

90
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:39,720
Shiya.

91
00:06:40,640 --> 00:06:41,560
Shiya.

92
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:43,920
Shiya.

93
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:47,080
Could something have happened to Shiya?

94
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:47,880
Look there.

95
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:50,280
Shiya.

96
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:51,159
Shiya.

97
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:51,960
Shiya.

98
00:06:52,280 --> 00:06:53,210
Call the police.

99
00:06:53,320 --> 00:06:54,120
Call for help.

100
00:06:54,320 --> 00:06:55,000
Shiya.

101
00:06:55,280 --> 00:06:55,960
Shiya.

102
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:31,160
Shiya.

103
00:07:31,440 --> 00:07:31,920
Shiya.

104
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:33,050
Calm down first.

105
00:07:33,400 --> 00:07:34,130
Don't panic.

106
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:34,960
I'm here.

107
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:38,040
Here.

108
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:38,820
Grab it.

109
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:42,440
There's a handhold on your upper left.

110
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:44,370
And a foothold on your lower right.

111
00:07:44,880 --> 00:07:45,610
Step firmly.

112
00:07:45,880 --> 00:07:47,140
Stay close to the wall.

113
00:07:49,159 --> 00:07:49,560
There.

114
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:51,450
There's another foothold.

115
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:53,970
Step firmly.

116
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:55,320
Hold on tight.

117
00:07:55,320 --> 00:07:56,200
Come up a bit more.

118
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:57,080
I'll catch you.

119
00:07:57,400 --> 00:07:58,200
Move forward.

120
00:07:58,200 --> 00:07:58,659
Come on.

121
00:07:59,000 --> 00:07:59,460
Come on.

122
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:01,880
Three.

123
00:08:25,640 --> 00:08:26,320
Shiya.

124
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:28,000
Shiya.

125
00:08:28,440 --> 00:08:29,360
Come on, get up.

126
00:08:32,200 --> 00:08:32,760
Shiya.

127
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:34,340
You scared me to death.

128
00:08:34,679 --> 00:08:35,480
How are you?

129
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:36,720
Are you hurt anywhere?

130
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:37,200
No.

131
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:37,840
I'm fine.

132
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:39,280
What happened?

133
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:41,039
How could you be so careless?

134
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:42,039
I...

135
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:43,840
I didn't check the equipment well.

136
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:44,960
Sorry to make everyone worry.

137
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:46,820
Shiya is an experienced climber.

138
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:49,680
She shouldn't have made such a rookie mistake.

139
00:08:49,760 --> 00:08:50,560
This rope...

140
00:09:19,400 --> 00:09:21,600
Those who survive a disaster are destined for good fortune.

141
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:22,240
Should we

142
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:23,880
go to that bar from last time

143
00:09:23,880 --> 00:09:24,680
to relax?

144
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:26,640
You are really carefree.

145
00:09:29,520 --> 00:09:30,240
It's fine.

146
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:30,960
It's fine.

147
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:32,400
I was scared to death.

148
00:09:35,520 --> 00:09:36,400
Let's go.

149
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:38,400
Brother, I'll help you pack.
